{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"minimumCut","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"capacity","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Cut","preciseIdentifier":"s:5Flows3CutV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/Cut","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"DirectedView","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols12DirectedViewV","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedView","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">? ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AdditiveArithmetic","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18AdditiveArithmeticP","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Comparable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SL","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The cut minimizes the capacity of the edges between a nonempty proper vertex set and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rest. The side holding the first vertex is the source side. Computed by Nagamochi–Ibaraki:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"maximum adjacency orderings that contract every edge whose scanned connection is at least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the best cut so far. Which minimum cut is returned when several exist is unspecified, but"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same input always gives the same cut."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When the edges of positive capacity do not connect the graph, the result is the cut of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value zero whose source side is the first vertex’s component, with every crossing edge."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Parallel capacities add and self-loops are ignored. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"capacity"},{"type":"text","text":" is called once per non-loop"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edge, in position order, before any work."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Sums are formed in a wider type than ","type":"text"},{"code":"C","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" where needed (","type":"text"},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"Int128","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for fixed-width","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"integers, ","type":"text"},{"code":"Double","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for ","type":"text"},{"code":"Float","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), so a contracted group’s connection may exceed ","type":"text"},{"code":"C","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s range.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Complexity","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(nm log n) in the worst case.","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Precondition","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every capacity is at least zero, not NaN and finite, and the minimum cut’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value fits in "},{"code":"C","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (it is at most every vertex’s capacity sum)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A global minimum cut over "},{"code":"directedView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or nil below two vertices."}],"metadata":{"title":"minimumCut(capacity:)","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"minimumCut","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"capacity","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Cut","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:5Flows3CutV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"DirectedView","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols12DirectedViewV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">?","kind":"text"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"GlobalMinimumCut.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Flows\/GlobalMinimumCut.swift#L484"},"modules":[{"name":"Flows","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}],"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5FlowsE10minimumCut8capacityAD0E0VyAA12DirectedViewVyxGqd__GSgqd__5Edges_5IndexQZXE_ts18AdditiveArithmeticRd__SLRd__lF","role":"symbol"},"